      "text": "{name}在门口站了一会儿。风停在洞口，没有跟进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "石室仍在身后。"
    },
    { "type": "end", "outcome": "returned" },
    { "type": "mark", "id": "back" },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "{name}退回石室。风停在洞口，没有跟进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "石室仍在身后。"
    },
    { "type": "end", "outcome": "returned" }
